description: "\"guarantees[5]: Explainable Decisions,Evidence-Based Decisions,Traceable History,Reproducible Reasoning,Continuous Evolution\""
spec:
  id: decision_types
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Ontology
  compiler_stage: Knowledge Representation
  description: Defines the complete ontology of engineering decisions. Engineering is fundamentally a sequence of constrained decisions made under uncertainty. Every Engineering Knowledge Record shall contain one or more Decision Records.
purpose: "\"\\\"Represent engineering decisions as structured, explainable, traceable knowledge objects.\\\"\""
ekr: "\"\\\"Every Engineering Knowledge Record must include\\\"[5]: Decision Type,Decision Context,Decision Evidence,Decision Confidence,Decision Outcome\""
success: Every engineering decision can be reconstructed from stored knowledge.
future:
  decision_graphs: true
  automated_recommendations: true
  confidence_calibration: true
  probabilistic_decisions: true
  decision_embeddings: true
